#: src/modules/Order/templates/admin/mod_order_settings_fraud_check.html.twig
msgid "Each order a client places in the client area is scored by the service before it is made (staff orders are not checked). An order scoring above the limit waits under Orders > Waiting for review: its invoice cannot be paid until you approve it. The client's email is sent hashed with its domain; card details are never sent. If the service cannot be reached or has no credit left, the order goes through and you get a notification."
msgstr "客戶在客戶區提交的每張訂單在建立前都會由該服務評分（職員訂單不會被檢查）。分數超過限制的訂單會在「訂單 > 等候審核」中等候：在您批准之前，其發票無法支付。客戶的電郵會以雜湊值連同其域名發送；信用卡資料永遠不會發送。如無法連接該服務或其額度已用完，訂單會照常進行，您會收到通知。"

#: src/modules/Servicedomain/templates/admin/mod_servicedomain_prices.html.twig
